Large strided copies can have ne[1] == 1 while copying many MiB through
ne[0], ne[2] or ne[3]. Partition those disjoint copies across existing CPU
compute threads instead of assigning the entire operation to thread zero.
The contiguous fast path and small/aliasing/overlapping layouts are unchanged.

Based on llama.cpp ddd4ec1428a6201e18975ea52b07c71e0f9aef26.

